{"seq":1,"slug":"css-architecture-patterns","title":"CSS 架构模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/css-and-visual-engineering/advanced-techniques/css-architecture-patterns","wordCount":757,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"css-架构模式\">CSS 架构模式</h1><h2 id=\"问题背景\">问题背景</h2><p>当项目规模增长，CSS 的维护难度会急剧上升——选择器冲突、优先级战争、难以复用和删除死代码。CSS 架构模式提供了组织和命名的系统化方法论，从经典的 BEM、ITCSS 到现代的 CUBE CSS 和 Utility-First，每种方法适用于不同的项目规模和团队偏好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CSS 架构模式回答的都是同一个问题——<strong>如何约束选择器的命名与层级</strong>：BEM 用&quot;块-元素-修饰符&quot;的命名约定把作用域写进类名，ITCSS 用倒三角把样式按&quot;通用性递减、特异性递增&quot;分层，CUBE CSS 则把组合、工具类与异常串成一套组合式方法论，各自在不同规模的团队中抑制冲突与腐化。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;CSS 架构模式&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;BEM&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;ITCSS&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;CUBE CSS&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;Utility-First&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; F[&quot;块-元素-修饰符命名&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; G[&quot;倒三角层级结构&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; H[&quot;组合+工具类+块+异常&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; I[&quot;原子化工具类&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"CSS 架构模式\"] --&gt; B[\"BEM\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"ITCSS\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"CUBE CSS\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"Utility-First\"]\n    B --&gt; F[\"块-元素-修饰符命名\"]\n    C --&gt; G[\"倒三角层级结构\"]\n    D --&gt; H[\"组合+工具类+块+异常\"]\n    E --&gt; I[\"原子化工具类\"]</pre><h2 id=\"bem-block-element-modifier\">BEM（Block-Element-Modifier）</h2><p>BEM 是最广泛使用的 CSS 命名规范，通过命名约定避免选择器嵌套和冲突：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* Block */&#10;.card {&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* Element（块的子部分） */&#10;.card__header {&#10;}&#10;.card__body {&#10;}&#10;.card__footer {&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* Modifier（变体或状态） */&#10;.card--featured {&#10;}&#10;.card--compact {&#10;}&#10;.card__header--centered {&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* Block */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.card</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* Element（块的子部分） */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.card__header</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.card__body</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.card__footer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* Modifier（变体或状态） */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.card--featured</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.card--compact</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.card__header--centered</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;article class=&quot;card card--featured&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;header class=&quot;card__header&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;h3 class=&quot;card__title&quot;&gt;标题&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;  &lt;/header&gt;&#10;  &lt;div class=&quot;card__body&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;p class=&quot;card__text&quot;&gt;内容&lt;/p&gt;&#10;  &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  &lt;footer class=&quot;card__footer&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;button class=&quot;card__action&quot;&gt;操作&lt;/button&gt;&#10;  &lt;/footer&gt;&#10;&lt;/article&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">article</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"card card--featured\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">header</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"card__header\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h3</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"card__title\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>标题&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">header</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"card__body\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">p</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"card__text\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>内容&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">footer</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"card__footer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">button</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"card__action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>操作&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">footer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">article</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"bem-核心规则\">BEM 核心规则</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规则</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>只用类选择器</td>\n<td>不用 ID、标签选择器</td>\n<td><code>.nav</code>（✓）<code>#nav</code>（✗）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扁平结构</td>\n<td>不嵌套元素</td>\n<td><code>.card__title</code>（✓）<code>.card__header__title</code>（✗）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>修饰符单独使用</td>\n<td>modifier 与 block/element 共存</td>\n<td><code>class=&quot;card card--large&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>选择器深度 = 1</td>\n<td>避免 <code>.card .card__title</code></td>\n<td><code>.card__title</code>（✓）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> BEM 的最大优势是<strong>所有选择器优先级相同</strong>（0,1,0），消除了优先级战争。缺点是类名冗长。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"itcss-inverted-triangle-css\">ITCSS（Inverted Triangle CSS）</h2><p>ITCSS 按照<strong>作用范围从宽到窄、优先级从低到高</strong>的倒三角形组织 CSS 文件：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;ITCSS 倒三角(上宽下窄)&quot;&#10;        direction TB&#10;        L1[&quot;Settings - 变量、令牌&quot;]&#10;        L2[&quot;Tools - 混入、函数&quot;]&#10;        L3[&quot;Generic - 重置、normalize&quot;]&#10;        L4[&quot;Elements - 裸标签样式&quot;]&#10;        L5[&quot;Objects - 结构性布局模式&quot;]&#10;        L6[&quot;Components - 具体 UI 组件&quot;]&#10;        L7[&quot;Utilities - 工具类(最高优先级)&quot;]&#10;        L1 --&gt; L2 --&gt; L3 --&gt; L4 --&gt; L5 --&gt; L6 --&gt; L7&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph \"ITCSS 倒三角(上宽下窄)\"\n        direction TB\n        L1[\"Settings - 变量、令牌\"]\n        L2[\"Tools - 混入、函数\"]\n        L3[\"Generic - 重置、normalize\"]\n        L4[\"Elements - 裸标签样式\"]\n        L5[\"Objects - 结构性布局模式\"]\n        L6[\"Components - 具体 UI 组件\"]\n        L7[\"Utilities - 工具类(最高优先级)\"]\n        L1 --&gt; L2 --&gt; L3 --&gt; L4 --&gt; L5 --&gt; L6 --&gt; L7\n    end</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* 1. Settings */&#10;:root {&#10;  --color-primary: #3b82f6;&#10;  --space-md: 1rem;&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 2. Tools（Sass 环境） */&#10;/* @mixin respond-to($bp) { ... } */&#10;&#10;/* 3. Generic */&#10;*,&#10;*::before,&#10;*::after {&#10;  box-sizing: border-box;&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 4. Elements */&#10;body {&#10;  font-family: system-ui;&#10;  line-height: 1.6;&#10;}&#10;a {&#10;  color: var(--color-primary);&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 5. Objects */&#10;.o-container {&#10;  max-width: 1200px;&#10;  margin: 0 auto;&#10;  padding: 0 1rem;&#10;}&#10;.o-stack &gt; * + * {&#10;  margin-top: var(--space-md);&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 6. Components */&#10;.c-card {&#10;  border: 1px solid var(--border);&#10;  border-radius: 8px;&#10;}&#10;.c-button {&#10;  padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;&#10;  border-radius: 6px;&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 7. Utilities */&#10;.u-hidden {&#10;  display: none !important;&#10;}&#10;.u-text-center {&#10;  text-align: center !important;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 1. Settings */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">:root</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --color-primary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">#3b82f6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --space-md</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 2. Tools（Sass 环境） */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* @mixin respond-to($bp) { ... } */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 3. Generic */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">::before</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">::after</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\