span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 混合方案（推荐） --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"c-hero flex flex-col items-center gap-4 py-20\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"c-hero__title text-4xl font-bold\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>标题&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">p</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"c-hero__subtitle text-lg text-gray-600\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>副标题&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 选择架构模式不是非此即彼的——很多成功的项目混合使用多种方法。关键是团队达成共识并<strong>保持一致</strong>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>BEM</strong> 通过命名约定实现扁平优先级，适合组件化开发</li>\n<li><strong>ITCSS</strong> 用倒三角层级组织 CSS，从全局到局部、从低优先级到高优先级</li>\n<li><strong>CUBE CSS</strong> 融合语义化和工具类，Composition 层管理布局，Block 层管理组件</li>\n<li><strong>Utility-First</strong> 用原子类消除 CSS 增长，配合组件框架效果最佳</li>\n<li>没有&quot;最好&quot;的架构——选择取决于项目规模、团队偏好和技术栈</li>\n<li>最重要的原则是<strong>一致性</strong>：选定方案后全团队遵循</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CSS 架构模式","id":"css-架构模式"},{"level":2,"text":"问题背景","id":"问题背景"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"BEM（Block-Element-Modifier）","id":"bem-block-element-modifier"},{"level":3,"text":"BEM 核心规则","id":"bem-核心规则"},{"level":2,"text":"ITCSS（Inverted Triangle CSS）","id":"itcss-inverted-triangle-css"},{"level":2,"text":"CUBE CSS","id":"cube-css"},{"level":2,"text":"架构模式对比","id":"架构模式对比"},{"level":2,"text":"语义化 vs 工具类","id":"语义化-vs-工具类"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"主题与暗色模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/css-and-visual-engineering/design-systems/theme-and-dark-mode"},"next":{"title":"CSS-in-JS 权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/css-and-visual-engineering/advanced-techniques/css-in-js-tradeoffs"}}